{"unit_id":"tag:06KC:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）。取完备化（completions），得到五元组（quintuple）<MATH_0003>。由注记<REF_0001>，完备化（completion）作为<MATH_0004>上的函子（functor）是右伴随（right adjoint），故它与极限（limits）交换（commutes）。特别地，有典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0005>，因此可以将<MATH_0006>视为函子（functor）<MATH_0007>。于是<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>上函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors），其恒等（identity）和逆（inverse）态射（morphisms）是<MATH_0010>中相应态射的完备化（completions）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"groupoid in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚"},{"source_term":"completions","target_term":"完备化"},{"source_term":"quintuple","target_term":"五元组"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"groupoid in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"completions","target_term":"完备化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"groupoid in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚","context":"空词表；函子中的群胚暂定。"},{"source_term":"completions","target_term":"完备化","context":"空词表；复数形式暂定。"},{"source_term":"quintuple","target_term":"五元组","context":"空词表；群胚结构的五元组暂定。"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化","context":"空词表；函子完备化暂定。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"空词表；函子暂定。"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随","context":"空词表；右伴随暂定。"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限","context":"空词表；复数形式暂定。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"空词表；与极限交换暂定。"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构","context":"空词表；典范同构暂定。"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等","context":"空词表；恒等态射的限定语暂定。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"空词表；逆态射的限定语暂定。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"空词表；复数形式暂定。"}],"notes":[]}
